   0.2500000000000000    0.2500000000000000    0.7500000000000000 Ge0+
   0.0000000000000000    0.5000000000000000    0.0000000000000000 Ge0+
   0.2500000000000000    0.7500000000000000    0.2500000000000000 Ge0+
   0.5000000000000000    0.0000000000000000    0.0000000000000000 Ge0+
   0.7500000000000000    0.2500000000000000    0.2500000000000000 Ge0+
   0.5000000000000000    0.5000000000000000    0.5000000000000000 Ge0+
   0.7500000000000000    0.7500000000000000    0.7500000000000000 Ge0+
K_POINTS automatic
